{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9bbf6db474ee456a1fc1b0992a5ddd48716439d4db0a93885de6bf1ad21033c2", "ja": "（今日は映画『アイドルスペースウォーズ』の\nシリーズ続編の撮影日！　期待度の高い人気作だ）", "zh": "（今天是电影《偶像太空大战》系列续篇的拍摄日！这可是部备受期待的人气作品。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f08ae9eb6c7ea77a23e1caaae7cf6e88f82f55d7d077b22ade8f41d7659e0c21", "ja": "（美奈子は宇宙戦艦の艦長で、邪悪な存在に精神を\n操られているという、技量を問われる役だが……）", "zh": "（美奈子饰演的是宇宙战舰的舰长，一个被邪恶存在操纵精神、十分考验演技的角色……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "6bffba9002ff87327d848925c4468a5c4931f99d15a0f19ee31876d1b85abfb2", "ja": "わたシたちヲ、じゃマすルものハ……\n排除、すル……ヒとリ、ノコらズ……う、ギギッ……！", "zh": "妨碍我、们的家伙……  \n排除……一个、不留……呜、咯叽……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "04787bfe71bbe5bc64e8154c16e381cc88326f1a6350a3a702017f98fe68ccf0", "ja": "カくごは、いイ……？　エネルギー砲、\nシャしゅつヨうイ……グッ、うゥ……うテぇッ！", "zh": "觉悟、做做好了吗……？能量炮，准准备发射……呃、呜……开火——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3d9b1de0674061d0c1473d65c544d3d55c5c99409172ad5979b5e09b956a7960", "ja": "お疲れ様、美奈子。迫真の演技だったな……\n手に汗握りながら見させてもらったよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，美奈子。刚才的演技真是逼真……\n\n看得我手心都冒汗了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "7d7b86cc594e7a90fdb98eda5b82605419b179fa124eabe0170c9c6f3e05da5d", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\n本当ですか？　うれしいな……えへへ♪", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n真的吗？好开心……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "24016b5be39c6bca5edbaf14ffff06a7a8bd22d073591d59c2dee658b5fb9c2b", "ja": "特にここは見せ場のシーンですからね。\n稽古の成果が出せたみたいで、ホッとしました♪", "zh": "尤其是这里可是展现实力的场景呢。\n看来排练的成果发挥出来了，我也松了口气♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f9736f15cc2d3d6ed67f4f93e8ffee0537cf23a9c01b29f70a59314d9cfa092d", "ja": "難しいところだよな。演技力も求められるし、\n何より、演者として気持ちの上でも。", "zh": "确实是个难点啊。不仅需要演技，更重要的是，作为演员在心理上也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "0ed2bbef4afdc415985b88d83a3f81e0f335f6df4c84c99fc8835dd22c84a3c3", "ja": "そうですね……昔の仲間を攻撃するなんて、\n心が痛まないって言ったらウソになりますけど……。", "zh": "是啊……要攻击曾经的伙伴，\n说心里一点都不难受，那肯定是骗人的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "93d25814708d576b0cbd0666bb20aa97649398e33add15eaa517ca39c1197c68", "ja": "でも、そういうのもひっくるめて、やりがいを\n感じてますよ！　難しいシーンだからこそ。", "zh": "但是，正因为把这些都包括在内，我才觉得这件事很有意义！正因为是困难的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1372f4f55a724495148bc99472890663016e1cd9b3a78c5200f9e79fce47fe35", "ja": "おお、むしろ燃えてたのか。", "zh": "哦，原来你反而干劲十足啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "7ac25c3db5cbb2b61857b506c2a82a58d39b04b27cf37baf5a8268a6ed4e3fa8", "ja": "はい！　だから、今みたいにほめてもらえると\nすっごくうれしいですし……。", "zh": "是的！所以像现在这样得到夸奖，我真的特别开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "c0902c3c25a64365a9878aed3a09fd875f900a480b516abce0c828a8bb732a06", "ja": "何より監督さんが、私にこういう役を\nやってほしいって、オファーしてくれたので！", "zh": "最重要的是，导演先生邀请我来出演这样的角色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "0d2dd1cc29b0af18f90d212ccbca6a2b59dd872bf905cab708b0651f4265e854", "ja": "それって、私ならきっとできる！って、\n期待してくれたからだと思うんですよね。", "zh": "我觉得，这是因为导演相信我，期待着“如果是我的话，一定能做到！”吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8628613dfc27b544de96224dfeacace17049e71462003594534175c1f6fe9d5e", "ja": "うん、それは間違いないな。\nプロデューサーとしても太鼓判を押すよ。", "zh": "嗯，那是肯定的。\n作为制作人，我也可以拍胸脯保证。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "1e91fbd4aa36b35327a8e67db33d1a9c614633026fe2876e45f51308f2a030ca", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪\n私も、期待には全力で応えたい！って思ってます。", "zh": "谢谢您♪\n我也想着，一定要全力回应大家的期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "8ffc736551a08913b3e051161407744f7fea000819776a12fadc09aacc77f142", "ja": "歌もダンスも好きですけど、お芝居もいけます！\nってところを、見せられたなぁ……なんて♪", "zh": "歌和舞蹈我都喜欢，不过演戏也不在话下！能让大家看到这一点了呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "b0510c43a80330df365b0b2a9c2787d42f9a766d5bafe368c3bdafd47493e820", "ja": "あっ。私、ちょっと調子に乗っちゃってますか？\nまだまだひよっこなのに。", "zh": "啊。我是不是有点得意忘形了？\n明明还只是个菜鸟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d5121e88fbea936309529e0bd0020c9d607603311f1cfe1ac733923397c5af9e", "ja": "いや、それくらいでいいと思うよ。\nファンのみんなに、今の美奈子の実力を見てもらおう！", "zh": "不，我觉得这样就很好。\n让粉丝们看看现在美奈子的实力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "edddae0e2c170d5bda2e049cfb90853541c0051bb3f09d6afa2f03000a44c201", "ja": "わっほーい！　{$P$}さん、\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "哇——呼！{$P$}先生，\n非常感谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0594_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "b7a6563d77041490b6f58a54a5f0cd1a16281188647f876d4192340578ffb88b", "ja": "それじゃあこのまま、勢いに乗って……\n歌もダンスも、お芝居も！", "zh": "那就乘着这股气势继续下去……\n歌曲、舞蹈，还有演技！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
